      "title": "Integration of Circular Economy into Metal Additive Manufacturing: A Review of Ultrasonic Plasma Atomization for Producing Virgin and Recycled NiTi Powder",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Mahyar Sojoodi, Alireza Behvar, ... Mohammad Elahinia"
